# The test bot's plan for The Wheatsheaf (crates/openinn/tests/bot.rs): each day it works down this
# list, doing what it can afford. Round the door at (6, 0): a passage running south, the common room
# to the west with the kitchen and cellar behind it and the kitchen garden beyond, the yard and the
# stables to the east, the chambers and the bathhouse south-east, the skittle alley to the south and,
# up the stairs, the quiet room and the hayloft. The first day's fourteen lines come first.
dig 6 1 porch
dig 6 2 porch
dig 5 1 taproom
dig 5 2 taproom
dig 4 1 taproom
dig 4 2 taproom
dig 3 1 kitchen
dig 2 1 kitchen
dig 3 2 cellar
build 5 1 bar
build 4 2 table
build 3 1 hearth
build 3 2 kegs
build 2 1 larder
# Day 2 and on, as money allows: a trough for the peddlers' mules, beds for the merchants, and a
# stall with a hayrick for their horses (reputation 8).
dig 7 1 yard
build 7 1 trough
build 4 1 stool               # beside the bar: the regulars' row
dig 8 1 yard
build 8 1 hayrick
dig 9 1 stables
build 9 1 stall
dig 6 3 porch
dig 7 2 chamber
dig 7 3 chamber
build 7 2 bed
build 7 3 bed
dig 9 2 stables
build 9 2 barrow              # beside the stall: a well-kept stable
# The fire pit in the common room, and more tables round it (the millers eat a lot).
dig 5 3 taproom
dig 4 3 taproom
build 4 3 fire
build 5 2 table               # within two cells of the fire: a fireside
dig 3 3 taproom
build 3 3 table
# Something for the soldiers' boredom (reputation 12): a skittle alley.
dig 6 4 porch
dig 5 4 alley
dig 5 5 alley
build 5 4 skittles
build 5 5 skittles            # two side by side: a skittle alley
dig 4 4 alley
build 4 4 banner              # beside the table at (3, 3): under the colours
build 6 2 pail                # a scullion for the floors
build 6 1 lantern
# A bathhouse for the quarrymen (reputation 15): a well in the kitchen garden for the copper.
build 6 3 washstand
dig 7 4 bathhouse
dig 8 4 bathhouse
dig 2 2 yard
build 2 2 well
build 8 4 copper
build 7 4 tub                 # beside the copper: a steam room
# Up the stairs: the quiet room for the pilgrims (25) and the scholars (30).
build 6 4 stairs
dig 6 4 1 porch
dig 5 4 1 parlour
dig 4 4 1 parlour
dig 5 5 1 parlour
dig 4 5 1 parlour
build 5 4 1 altar
build 4 4 1 lantern
build 5 5 1 lantern           # two by the prayer corner: lit prayers
build 4 5 1 desk
# The kitchen garden and the bread oven: pies.
dig 1 2 yard
dig 1 3 yard
dig 2 3 yard
build 1 2 vegpatch
build 1 3 vegpatch
build 2 3 herbbed
dig 1 1 kitchen
build 1 1 oven
# A stage for the bards (reputation 20), within two cells of the bar: a sing-song.
build 5 3 stage
dig 4 5 alley
build 4 5 draughts
dig 8 2 chamber
build 8 2 flowers
dig 8 3 chamber
build 8 3 bed
dig 3 5 1 parlour
dig 3 4 1 parlour
build 3 5 1 bookcase
build 3 4 1 bookcase          # two beside the desk: a quiet corner
dig 7 4 1 loft
build 7 4 1 pallet
dig 7 5 1 chamber
build 7 5 1 bed
# Strewing herbs in the stables, a second stall and a second bar.
dig 10 1 stables
build 10 1 stall
dig 10 2 stables
build 10 2 strewing
# The post horses for the royal messengers (reputation 40): needs the royal post from the market,
# which the bot never buys.
dig 9 3 stables
build 9 3 posthorse
